// SongAssignmentWrapper: Wraps SongAssignmentView and overlays a fixed Ready button during song_selection phase. NOT concerned with song data fetching logic (delegated to SongAssignmentView). | I/O: roomStore.status, roomStore.readyPlayers → renders SongAssignmentView + optional Ready overlay

┌─────────────────────────────────────────┐
│         SongAssignmentWrapper           │
│                                         │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │                                 │    │
│  │      @SongAssignmentView        │    │
│  │      (full screen content)      │    │
│  │                                 │    │
│  │                                 │    │
│  │                                 │    │
│  └─────────────────────────────────┘    │
│                                         │
│  [fixed bottom overlay — only during    │
│   song_selection phase]                 │
│                                         │
│  ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  │
│  ░  bg-gradient-to-t from-zinc-950  ░  │
│  ░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░░  │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────┐    │
│  │    max-w-md centered container  │    │
│  │                                 │    │
│  │  STATE 1: not yet ready         │    │
│  │  ╔═════════════════════════╗    │    │
│  │  ║        Ready            ║    │    │  ← bg-green-600, rounded-full, w-full
│  │  ╚═════════════════════════╝    │    │    disabled+opacity-50 while isMarkingReady
│  │                                 │    │    label: "Marking ready..." while pending
│  │  STATE 2: already ready         │    │
│  │  ┌─────────────────────────┐    │    │
│  │  │       Ready ✓           │    │    │  ← bg-zinc-800, text-green-400,
│  │  └─────────────────────────┘    │    │    border border-green-500/30, rounded-full
│  └─────────────────────────────────┘    │
└─────────────────────────────────────────┘

STATES
------
song_selection + !isReady  → green "Ready" button shown; click → POST /ready → optimistic markPlayerReady()
song_selection + isReady   → green "Ready ✓" pill shown (non-interactive)
any other phase            → overlay not rendered (v-if="roomStore.status === 'song_selection'")

NOTES
-----
- Overlay is position:fixed bottom-0 left-0 right-0 so it floats above SongAssignmentView scroll content
- Gradient fades from zinc-950 at bottom to transparent at top to soften the overlay edge
- isMarkingReady disables the button and changes label to "Marking ready..." (no separate loading spinner)
